			<div class="content" id="post-content-2544943">
									

<p>Agreed on the statement re: Dr. Warm (bit of a silly name, in my opinion, but I've seen goofier). Seems like it can be taken out without hurting the piece too much?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>there's something eerie about that photo, and knowing that there's supposed to be 4 people in that picture makes it eerier</p>
</blockquote>
<p>That's what I like the most about this article. That, and the ending note about the boots. There are plenty of deaths caused by tramplings out there (Black Friday sales, anyone?) but the fact that these people aren't stampeding, aren't even trying to push someone out of the way, but are doing so anyway, lends a strong lingering afterthought of &quot;what am <em>I</em> failing to notice in my life?&quot;</p>
<p>Anyway, I remember seeing this in the forums, and liking it there too. +1 from me.</p>
<p><sub>Author, consider thanking the other people who helped you out in chat/PMs in your first post~</sub></p>

